            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>The finance team suspects that some high-sales orders may be reducing overall profit. </run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Task :- Analyze the relationship between Sales and Profit to identify loss-making or low-profit orders.</run>
